# Morrowind Temple: Tharer Rotheloth's "Necromancer in Mawia" (TT_Mawia). Tharer Rotheloth names the necromancer
# Delvam Andarys ("Delvam Andarys": 10); with him dead, Tharer Rotheloth thanks the player (100).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel, the kill for the fight. Ref FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05:
# 055B5A84 Delvam Andarys.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tt_mountkand_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tt_mawia_start
talk tharer rotheloth
ask duties
ask Delvam Andarys
expect GetJournalIndex TT_Mawia == 10
bye
end

case tt_mawia_delvam
run
player->PositionCell 152 1250 -492 0 "Mawia"
until 600 "delvam andarys"->GetDistance player < 1500
wait 120
console 055B5A84.kill
until 600 GetDeadCount "delvam andarys" >= 1
end

case tt_mawia_done
run
player->PositionCell 378 -280 3 0 "Molag Mar, Temple"
until 600 "tharer rotheloth"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk tharer rotheloth
ask Delvam Andarys
expect GetJournalIndex TT_Mawia == 100
bye
end
